      "statement": ".cargo/config.toml is the single source of target flags: target-cpu=x86-64-v3 for desktop targets, x86-64-v2 for NAS musl targets, and --cfg reqwest_unstable for every target; the Linux desktop release reuses the gnu entry via cargo zigbuild --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.2.17, which needs no separate entry.",
